KRdp is a library and server implementing the Remote Desktop Protocol
(RDP) for KDE Plasma. It shares the running Plasma Wayland session with
RDP clients, using KWin's screencast protocol (or the xdg-desktop-portal
RemoteDesktop portal) for video and libei for input.

It includes the krdpserver daemon and a System Settings module for
configuring users, passwords and video quality.
